# ── skill-consolidation: clone-and-go ignore list ───────────────────────────
# Ship the TOOL + the INDEX. Ignore anything personal, regenerable, large, or secret.
# The generator (gen-skills-index.mjs) always re-derives artifacts from ~/.claude/skills,
# so derived state is never source-of-truth.

# Secrets — never commit. Fill these locally; setup.sh reads them.
.env
.env.local
*.token
*.secret

# Semantic vector corpus — 18 MB, locked to one model; regenerate with `--embed`.
SKILLS-EMBEDDINGS.json

# Local boot artifact rendered from the template by setup.sh (contains your $HOME).
com.skills-embed.plist
skills-embed.service
skills-embed.timer

# Logs & telemetry (machine-local, append-only).
*.log
*.jsonl

# Runtime / scratch / derived state.
run-state/
scratch/
references-staging/
backups/
audits/
.last-update-result.json
tiering/tier-state.json
tiering/*.jsonl

# Python bytecode (helper scripts).
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Editor / OS noise.
.DS_Store
*.bak
*.bak.*
*.bak-*
*~
.vscode/
.idea/
